#. ~ Description of monster "flying shark"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid ""
"It would be funny watching a shark swim through the air, between trees and "
"other objects like kelp under the water.  If it didn't mean the shark was "
"still completely real and capable of flying after you.  Something is very "
"wrong about things here."
msgstr ""

