msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "endless snake"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid ""
"The tail of this snake doesn't seem to end.  Clearly there are places that "
"are not part of the tail of this snake, but when you watch it move you only "
"see the front of the body move forward while the rear stays in it's place "
"eternally elongating.  But that can't be true so your eyes snap to somewhere "
"else and that seems to be an appropriately length snake, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

