#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
msgid "monochrome zombie"
msgid_plural "monochrome zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "monochrome zombie"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
msgid ""
"What stands in front of you is one of the healthiest zombies you've ever "
"seen.  If not for the black muck oozing from its orifices and shambling gait,"
" you might even think it human.  Every part of this zombie, even its clothes,"
" is colored some shade of gray, and every couple of seconds it flickers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "monochrome zombie"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "distorted zombie"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "zombie timewound"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s flickers and all of its injuries disappear!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
msgid "distorted zombie"
msgid_plural "distorted zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "distorted zombie"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
msgid ""
"This zombie is partially obscured by the gray, distorted air around it.  From"
" what you can see it doesn't have a single wound on its body, and it moves "
"much quicker than a zombie should.  Every few seconds the distortions surge."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
msgid "zombie timewound"
msgid_plural "zombie timewounds"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie timewound"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
msgid ""
"Every bit of color around this zombie has been sapped a distorted gray.  In "
"contrast with its healthy appearance, the surrounding environment seems to "
"slowly erode, even after it swiftly moves away.  It sharply flickers every "
"few seconds."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "zombie timewound"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
#, c-format
msgid "The ground around %1$s starts eroding into nothingness."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
msgid "monochrome boomer"
msgid_plural "monochrome boomers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "monochrome boomer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
msgid ""
"A rotund human body, bloated beyond belief.  Its entire body is tainted gray,"
" and it seems to emit a pulsating distortion that saps color from the world "
"around it.  Every few seconds the world around it seems to freeze, and its "
"likely that any damage will easily detonate the distorted time the zombie "
"barely holds within itself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Death message of monster "monochrome boomer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
#, c-format
msgid "Everything around the %s suddenly stops!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/chronomancer_traits.json
msgid "Living Paradox"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Living Paradox"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/chronomancer_traits.json
msgid ""
"You have an intimate sense for the flow of time, and you can use your power "
"to manipulate it.  Activate this trait to spend learned insight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/chronomancer_traits.json
msgid "Time Looped Knife Wound"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Time Looped Knife Wound"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/chronomancer_traits.json
msgid ""
"You have suffered a time looped wound, forcing you to repeatedly endure the "
"harm of an earlier wound.  Every 24 hours you are impaled by a non-existent "
"knife."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/chronomancer_traits.json
msgid "Slowed Timestream"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slowed Timestream"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/chronomancer_traits.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your timestream remains slightly slower than baseline reality.  You act 10% "
"slower."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/chronomancer_traits.json
msgid "Unstable Chronomancy"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Unstable Chronomancy"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/chronomancer_traits.json
msgid ""
"Your chronomantic powers have inherent instability.  While attempting to "
"maintain them over long periods of time, your powers may randomly fail."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid "Dreamer"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dreamer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid ""
"Dreamers are people who are able to tap into the power of dreams and nearby "
"dimensions and create fantastical effects as a result.  They can even pull "
"some of this dream material into our world to build other things with it.  "
"Sometimes they hear outside voices that offer help and presents, and with "
"enough power, dreamers can pull them right from beyond.  Their power scales "
"with their natural perception and intellect."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid "Eater of Dreams"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eater of Dreams"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid ""
"These people are aware of this cross-dimensional contamination and while they"
" can't pull anything over and make new things, they can eat anything they "
"find in our world that doesn't belong and gain abilities and powers from that"
" consumption.  They have larger than normal mana pools but regen that mana "
"much slower as a result, they can cast a spell to convert dreamdross scraps "
"directly into mana.  Their power scales with their natural strength and "
"dexterity."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid "Dreamsmith"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dreamsmith"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid ""
"Dreamsmiths can forge dreamdross into a more durable form and create "
"permanent items that can be repaired."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mad Genius"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid ""
"The Mad Genius uses their connection to other dimensions in order to "
"manipulate or even replace the physics of this realm with that of another.  "
"They turn toys and nonsense inventions into machines of incredible "
"sophistication and power, temporarily."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid "Hedgecraft"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hedgecraft"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid ""
"The craft of the wise, provenance of cunning men, wise women, soothsayers, "
"knowers, herb-witches, and curse-lifters throughout history.  With the proper"
" components, and at the proper times and places, they can perform miracles."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/cybernetic_traits.json
msgid "XEDRA Neurobionic Interface"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "XEDRA Neurobionic Interface"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/cybernetic_traits.json
msgid ""
"The compact bionic command and control interface interwoven with your nervous"
" system had a previous life inside of a cybernetic tribesperson.  Best case "
"scenario, none of them are on this Earth."
msgstr ""

