#. ~ Description of mutation "Ierde"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Arvore"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Undine"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Salamander"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sylph"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Homullus"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_thresh.json
msgid "You have ascended into your fae nature."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Dreamless"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dreamless"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You live firmly in reality and never experience extremely vivid dreams about "
"choices that have real world consequences.  ( You will be unable to gain "
"Dream magicks from sleeping after strange events)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Transformed into Goblin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Transformed into Spider"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You feel like you've left behind your old life and form."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Transformed into Spider"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ki Strike"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Who needs weapons?  You deal more melee damage while fighting barehanded and "
"without gloves.  This damage improves as your unarmed skill increases."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Extended Life"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extended Life"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You swallow the potion and feel younger already.  Though the taste lingers "
"long past when you'd hope it would pass."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Dhampir"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dhampir"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a dhampir, the child of a vampire.  You have inherited a portion of their vampiric power, as well as the ability to drink blood.  Hopefully you can keep your urges under control.\n"
"\n"
"As a dhampir, your blood naturally slowly fills with power over time, which you can use to fuel your abilities."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Blood Calls to Blood"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood Calls to Blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can use the connection of your heritage to sense nearby vampires and "
"their minions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "vampire_sense"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You sense one of the vampires' servants here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "vampire_sense"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You sense a vampire here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Dhampir Fangs"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dhampir Fangs"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a set of small fangs, not as long as a true vampire's, but on the "
"other hand, you can retract them to more easily conceal them.  Activate to "
"extend your fangs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Cold as the Grave"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cold as the Grave"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your half-dead flesh is inured to winter's chill.  As long as you have "
"empowered blood in your body, you suffer much less from colder temperatures."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "One Foot in the Grave"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "One Foot in the Grave"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The deathly energies that course through your veins are inimical to mundane "
"poisons and diseases.  As long as you have empowered blood in your body, you "
"are more resistant to disease, poison, and infection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Light as the Last Breath"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Light as the Last Breath"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"While unable to ignore gravity like a true vampire, it has less of a hold on "
"you.  You can fall one story without ill effect and take greatly-reduced fall"
" damage as long as you have empowered blood in your body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Half-Dead Flesh"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Half-Dead Flesh"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Being born closer to death, you feel the sensations of the living less "
"strongly.  You suffer much less pain from your injuries than a human would, "
"and the pain affects your capabilities less."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "A Thousand Years of Night"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "A Thousand Years of Night"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are only half-alive now, sustained as much by the energy in your blood as"
" by biological processes.  You age far slower than a mortal, and when your "
"limbs break, they heal more quickly in proportion to how much empowered blood"
" you have."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Blood is the Life"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"While you must normally eat, sleep, and drink as a mortal must, in times of need you can put that off.  Activate this trait to reduce your need for food, water, and sleep to zero.  While active, the Blood is the Life will continually expend the power in your blood, and when it wears off, you will become exhausted in proportion to how long the trait was active.  You spend <color_yellow>much more blood</color> if outdoors in the sunlight.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 1 ml (<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 1 ml per minute"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weakness: Sun Sensitivity"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Sun Sensitivity"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"While you won't burn in the sunlight like a true vampire, it's not "
"comfortable.  You suffer a -1 penalty to all stats when outdoors during the "
"daytime, and an additional -2 if it's sunny or clear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weakness: Nocturnal"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Nocturnal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You aren't forced to slumber the day away, but you sure want to.  Your "
"sleepiness accumulates much faster while the sun is in the sky, but you have "
"an easier time sleeping during the day."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weakness: Slow Healing"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Slow Healing"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Being so close to death has slowed down the processes of your living cells "
"considerably.  You heal at 50% of the normal rate."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weakness: Animal Hatred"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Animal Hatred"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Animals can sense your dead blood and they hate it.  They may run or be "
"aggressive to you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weakness: Burned by Water"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Burned by Water"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"While running water is not deadly to you, it is uncomfortable.  Moving "
"through running water without a boat will cause pain."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weakness: Corpselike Pallor"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Corpselike Pallor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has the obviously-unnatural grayish-white tinge of a corpse, and "
"mortals will react appropriately to seeing it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weakness: Overwhelming Arrogance"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Overwhelming Arrogance"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The vampires are right about one thing; they are better than humans, and your"
" vampire blood makes you better as well."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weakness: Bloodlust"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Bloodlust"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have tasted blood and that taste forever lingers in the back of your "
"mind.  You will get cravings for blood that only time or drinking more blood "
"can sate."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weakness: Thirst of the Damned"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Thirst of the Damned"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Fresh blood has an energy that mortal food simply cannot compare to.  You "
"gain 33% reduced kcal from the food you eat, but additional calories from "
"drinking blood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weakness: Decreased Blood Empowerment"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Decreased Blood Empowerment"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The power of fresh stolen blood lingers in your veins.  The natural rate that"
" your blood empowers itself is cut in half."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Infected with the vampire disease"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Infected with the vampire disease"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have developed a thirst for the blood of your fellow humans."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Blood Arts"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood Arts"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"This provides the school trait for vampire blood powers.  It should not be "
"visible."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Gleaming Eyes"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gleaming Eyes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes gleam lightly red as the light catches in them and with a few drops of the stolen blood in your veins you are able to see in the dark.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 100 ml (<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 50 ml"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Sanguine Ecstasy"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sanguine Ecstasy"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your palate adapted to your new condition.  Drinking human blood will make "
"you feel great."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vigor Mortis"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your stolen blood reinforces your muscles, making your grip crack bone and your punches dent steel.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 150 ml (<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 75 ml"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sanguine Resilience"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your cold flesh is not as vulnerable as it once was.  Activate to render it even more resistant to physical damage.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 150 ml (<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 75 ml"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Predator's Senses"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Predator's Senses"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your senses are heightened, allowing you to see more clearly, hear even tiny "
"sounds, and smell nearby fresh human blood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Blush of Health"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blush of Health"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The power of stolen blood keeps you feel amazing.  As long as you are not "
"suffering from the Withering, you gain a bonus to your health."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Silent as Death"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Silent as Death"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your movements don't make nearby as much noise as they used to."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Blood Lungs"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood Lungs"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your fingers have developed bloodsucking properties, you can now suck up "
"blood through them.  You're not sure where the blood goes but with a thought "
"you can use these deposits."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "vampire_stamina_for_blood_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Unholy Endurance"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Unholy Endurance"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your exhaust some of the blood in your veins to boost and recover some of "
"your spent stamina."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "vampire_commune_with_night_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Learn from the Children of the Night"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Learn from the Children of the Night"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You call out to the creatures that inhabit the night.  Wolves, bats, rats and"
" more.  They tell you about what terrain surrounds you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Sense the Children of the Night"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sense the Children of the Night"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can sense the presence of nearby predatory night creatures."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "night_creature_sense"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You sense one of the creatures of the night."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Walking the shadowed path of blood"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Walking the shadowed path of blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have new fangs to go along with your thirst for blood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Coagulant Weave"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body prepares to prevent the loss of any blood to combat damage.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 500 ml (<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 250 ml"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_blood_heal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Sanguine Restoration"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sanguine Restoration"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your flesh heals visibly while blood disintegrates hidden inside your veins."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Flow Like Blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can move faster than the eye can see, avoiding the claws and teeth and weapons of your enemies.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 250 (<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 125 ml"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cloak of Shadows"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"When indoors or at night, you can cloud the minds of nearby enemies, making it harder for them to spot you.  This does not make you invisible.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 100 (<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 50 ml"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "vampire_fear_gaze_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Predator's Mien"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Predator's Mien"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"With a bit of stolen blood and a savage expression, you can send your enemies"
" fleeing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Corpse's Countenance"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are close enough to death now that you can easily imitate it; your "
"heartbeat slows to a near-stop, your breathing ceases, your flesh grows pale,"
" and you show no signs of life.  You will be unable to move or act while "
"feigning death, but enemies will generally ignore you.  You will be unable to"
" feign death twice in a short time if you are seen ending your masquerade."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Spider's Walk"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spider's Walk"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Gravity seems to have less of an effect than it used it.  With barely an "
"effort you can ascend or descend even sheer walls, and you can fall any "
"distance and land on your feet uninjured."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Claws of the Beast"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Claws of the Beast"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can twist your fingernails into sharp claws, allowing you to inflict extra damage in unarmed combat.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 125 ml (<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 62 ml"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Crimson Vision"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crimson Vision"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your vision has improved and now you can see flowing blood in the vein, like "
"bright trails in the dark."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Carmine Vitality"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Blood fills you with a surge of power.  You gain a bonus to your strength and"
" dexterity for one hour after drinking blood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mortal hungers are replaced with immortal hungers"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mortal hungers are replaced with immortal
#. hungers"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You replace some of your regular caloric intake with blood and begin to see "
"some of the more esoteric abilities inherent to vampirism."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_hypnotic_gaze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Hypnotic Gaze"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hypnotic Gaze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can mesmerize your prey, gazing into their eyes and freezing them in "
"their tracks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood-Driven Speed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body exceeds normal human reaction limits as blood turns to ash in your veins.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 750 ml (<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 375 ml"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "vampire_magic_for_blood_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Blood-Fueled Magic"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood-Fueled Magic"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your exhaust some of the blood in your veins to recover some of your spent "
"mana."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "vampire_command_beast_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Cowing the Beast"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cowing the Beast"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are a supreme predator, and other predators bow at your feet."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "vampire_earth_slumber_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Earthen Slumber"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthen Slumber"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can sleep within the earth itself, avoiding the hateful light of the sun."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Incarnadine Energy"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Incarnadine Energy"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The stolen blood within your body provides you with a fountain of energy.  "
"You gain a bonus to your Cardio rating."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Wakeful Slumber"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wakeful Slumber"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your senses are so fine they can alert you to danger even while you slumber."
"  Activate to cause yourself to wake up if danger approaches while you sleep."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fortitude of the Damned"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fortitude of the Damned"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your flesh is more resilient and you can suffer much more damage than a "
"mortal before expiring.  Your hit points are increased."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Discarded their mortality"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Discarded their mortality"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have become a true vampire and are beginning to see some of the most "
"potent abilities vampirism has to offer."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "True Vampire's Potence"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "True Vampire's Potence"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your new status as a true vampire has empowered your other abilities."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampire_torpor"
#. ~ Name of spell "vampire_torpor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Torpor"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Torpor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can enter a deathlike stake known as torpor, in which your wounds will "
"close faster, your fatigue will fully recover and your blood thirst will be "
"less intense.  Be careful, though, as nothing will be able to wake you up "
"until eight hours have passed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "vampire_dominate"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Dominating Gaze"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dominating Gaze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can focus your gaze and take control of your target.  Only works against "
"targets that have a mind."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Facultative Breathing"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facultative Breathing"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You do not need to breathe air to live anymore.  It prevents you from being "
"drowned or suffocated and allows you to ignore inhaled gases."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Corpse-like Flesh"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Corpse-like Flesh"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your undead body is now much more dead than alive.  It prevents mundane "
"illnesses and parasites from affecting you, while granting you a total "
"immunity against radiation.  In addition, your scent is now something most "
"mundane creatures cannot understand."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Shape of the Night Flier"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shape of the Night Flier"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can transform yourself into a bat and take wing on the night air."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Shape of the Pack Hunter"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shape of the Pack Hunter"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can transform yourself into a wolf and stalk your enemies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Shape of the Billowing Mists"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shape of the Billowing Mists"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can transform yourself into a cloud of mist and flee any dangers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fully fueled by the Blood"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fully fueled by the Blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"By reaching the final stage of vampirism, you have freed yourself from your "
"mundane needs.  The only sustenance you need now is blood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Master the Mortal Mind"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Master the Mortal Mind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your ability to influence others has amplified.  You can now spend blood "
"while talking with someone else to make them like you more, with the "
"costliest application of this power being able to turn them into your "
"obsessed servants.  Not all can be influenced by this power, for anger, panic"
" and strong ties to a group that isn't yours will disrupt the process.  Other"
" vampires and the rare saint-blooded are also immune to it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Distillate the Inner Blood"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Distillate the Inner Blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Unlike lesser vampires who bloat as they gorge on blood, you concentrate the "
"blood you consume, making it fit nicely in your veins.  This removes the "
"penalties for containing too much blood, but doesn't expand your maximal "
"capacity."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Shape of the Shadowed Path"
msgstr ""
